What:           /sys/class/qcom-battery/bypass_charging_enable
Date:           November 2026
Contact:        peridot device maintainers
Description:
                Enables Xiaomi firmware scene-based adapter bypass charging.
                Write 1 to request bypass and 0 to restore the charger scene
                captured before bypass. Reads return 0 or 1; while the
                asynchronous transition runs they return 0-pending or
                1-pending. A second request during transition returns EBUSY.
                Enabling without an online USB supply returns ENODEV. Cable
                removal automatically restores the captured charger scene.

What:           /sys/class/qcom-battery/bypass_charging_mode
Date:           November 2026
Contact:        peridot device maintainers
Description:
                Selects the Xiaomi smart-charging scene used for bypass.
                Accepted values are navigation, tgame, and nolimit. Reading
                lists all values and encloses the selected value in brackets.
                The mode cannot change while bypass is active or transitioning.
